domain ADR0076:
  description "Accepted revision1: versioned per-action rejection of invalid canonical updates with feedback."
evidence STAGE_FAILURE:
  "Stage38189337992 committed8turns/36attempts, then charged4MP from1MP. Strict reducer rejected turn9; no world/memory commit. Cumulative97attempts, production not promoted."
premise CONTRACT:
  "Policy v5/output v3/prompt v5 mechanically canonicalize unambiguous reservation order/side/baseRevision, reject invalid per-action effects with acting-side feedback, cancel after defeat and retain raw evidence. Ambiguous structure gets max1error-directed corrective call sharing original role deadline and physical accounting; second invalid received response yields explicit failed receipts so the turn continues. Normal4calls; exceptional5. Old policies remain strict, unknown sends never replay. Additional corrected fixed1battle max164attempts stays within cumulative261 after97used."
evidence OWNER_ACCEPTANCE:
  "2026-10-12 owner directs 裁定の間違いは、機械判定できる部分は自動修復やエラー明示でのやり直しにすべきですよね。 Existing explicit repair retries and 対戦、試行、切り替えまで承認 remain authority; do not ask again for the same recovery/deployment work."
decision ACCEPTANCE based_on STAGE_FAILURE, CONTRACT, OWNER_ACCEPTANCE:
  "Accept revision1. Implement versioned recovery, full regressions and individual authority reviews; exact-source CI and corrected immutable candidate before fixed Stage within remaining164physical attempts. Promote only successful exact Stage artifacts. Preserve all five failures and old contracts."
